{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“非分歧的局部环同态”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"非分歧的局部环同态"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称局部环同态 $f\\colon A\\to B$ 非分歧是指如下等价的条件之一成立:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$B/f(\\mathfrak m_A)B$ 是 $A/\\mathfrak m_A$ 的有限可分扩域;</li>\n<li>$f(\\mathfrak m_A)B=\\mathfrak m_B$, 且 $B/\\mathfrak m_B$ 是 $A/\\mathfrak m_A$ 的有限可分扩域.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"非分歧概形态射","text":"非分歧概形态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}